mlx-fastframes-swift

Port of FastFrames (https://github.com/apple-aiml-research/ml-fastframes @ a65c592):
  Copyright (C) 2026 Apple Inc. All Rights Reserved. The inference code translated here (the frame-causal Wan DiT
  forward, KV refinement network, pixel decoder and rollout of fastframes/pipeline.py, stock path) is Apple software
  under the Apple Sample Code License included in that repository. This is a modified translation to Swift/MLX.

FastFrames-S's generator is the Causal Forcing++ framewise-2step checkpoint (https://github.com/thu-ml/Causal-Forcing,
https://huggingface.co/zhuhz22/Causal-Forcing), Apache-2.0, on the Wan2.1 architecture
(https://github.com/Wan-Video/Wan2.1), Apache-2.0. Prompt encoding uses wan-core-mlx-swift's umT5 encoder.

